# WBS-GMM-EP-001: Authentication and Auditing Foundation

## Overview
This WBS breaks down the implementation of the Authentication and Auditing Foundation (GMM-EP-001), covering JWT management, session handling, rate limiting, and the immutable audit log schema/service.

## Contracts
| ID | Kind | Path |
|---|---|---|
| AUTH-API | openapi | contracts/openapi/auth.yaml |
| AUDIT-SCHEMA | schema_plan | contracts/schema/audit-log-plan.md |

## Items

### 1. Core JWT Utilities
- **ID**: GMM-US-001/005
- **Role**: developer
- **Title**: Implement JWT generation and validation utility
- **Paths**: `app/auth/jwt.util.ts`
- **Contracts**: []
- **AC**: 
    - AC-JWT-01: Generate valid access tokens (15m TTL)
    - AC-JWT-02: Generate valid refresh tokens (7d TTL)
    - AC-JWT-03: Verify JWT signature and expiration
    - AC-JWT-04: Return decoded payload on valid JWT
- **Depends On**: []

### 2. Authentication Service
- **ID**: GMM-US-001
- **Role**: developer
- **Title**: Implement Authentication Service logic
- **Paths**: `app/auth/auth.service.ts`
- **Contracts**: []
- **AC**: 
    - AC-AUTH-01: Verify user credentials (mocked/assumed)
    - AC-AUTH-02: Coordinate token pair generation
- **Depends On**: [GMM-US-001/005]

### 3. Authentication Controller & Endpoints
- **ID**: GMM-US-002/003/004/006
- **Role**: developer
- **Title**: Expose Auth Endpoints (Login, Refresh, Logout)
- **Paths**: 
    - `app/auth/auth.controller.ts`
- **Contracts**: [AUTH-API]
- **AC**: 
    - AC-API-01: POST /api/v1/auth/login (200 + httpOnly cookies)
    - AC-API-02: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh (200 + new TokenPair)
    - AC-API-03: POST /api/v1/auth/logout (Invalidate session)
    - AC-API-04: Invalid credentials return 401
    - AC-API-05: Expired refresh token returns 403
- **Depends On**: [GMM-US-001/005, GMM-US-001]

### 4. Authentication Middleware
- **ID**: GMM-US-006
- **Role**: developer
- **Title**: Implement Authentication Middleware
- **Paths**: `app/auth/auth.middleware.ts`
- **Contracts**: []
- **AC**: 
    - AC-MID-01: Validate token via utility
    - AC-MID-02: Attach User to request context
    - AC-MID-03: Handle 401 Unauthorized
- **Depends On**: [GMM-US-001/005]

### 5. Rate Limiting
- **ID**: GMM-EP-001-RL
- **Role**: developer
- **Title**: Implement IP-based Rate Limiting
- **Paths**: `app/middleware/rate_limiter.ts`
- **Contracts**: []
- **AC**: 
    - AC-RL-01: Limit login attempts to 10 per minute per IP
- **Depends On**: []

### 6. Audit Log Foundation
- **ID**: GMM-US-007/008
- **Role**: developer
- **Title**: Implement AuditLog Schema and Immutability
- **Paths**: 
    - `app/audit/audit.schema.ts`
    - `app/audit/audit.service.ts`
- **Contracts**: [AUDIT-SCHEMA]
- **AC**: 
    - AC-AUDIT-01: Implement AuditLog schema (actor_id, timestamp, resource_id, delta)
    - AC-AUDIT-02: Enforce append-only constraints (DB level/triggers)
- **Depends On**: []

## Critical Modules
- `app/auth`
- `app/audit`

## NFRs
- **Performance**: Auth API p95 < 300ms
- **Security**: httpOnly cookies, immutable audit logs, rate limiting
